# A Place to Return (CoP 6-2) played through. A level 75 Warrior of San d'Oria with 6-2 current (a GM; Status 0):
# Ru'Lude Gardens' trigger area 1: 10048 (finished: Status 1). Pherimociel 28, Auchefort 10055, and the four bystanders
# (Adolie 158, Chapi Galepilai 12, Colti 22, Neraf-Najiruf 31, once per zone; Neraf-Najiruf's second trigger: 156, the
# default). Misareaux Coast's Dilapidated Gate (_0p0) pops the three Wardens (no action); a second trigger with them
# alive: message 7375; each Warder killed sets its Option bit; with all three (Option 7) the gate plays 10 (finished:
# the mission completes, 6-3 current).
lists RuludeGardens/Pherimociel/onTrigger RuludeGardens/Auchefort/onTrigger RuludeGardens/Adolie/onTrigger RuludeGardens/Chapi_Galepilai/onTrigger RuludeGardens/Colti/onTrigger RuludeGardens/Neraf-Najiruf/onTrigger RuludeGardens/onTriggerAreaEnter/1 RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/10048 MisareauxCoast/_0p0/onTrigger MisareauxCoast/Warder_Aglaia/onMobDeath MisareauxCoast/Warder_Euphrosyne/onMobDeath MisareauxCoast/Warder_Thalia/onMobDeath MisareauxCoast/onEventFinish/10
char zone=RuludeGardens pos=0,3,10 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Cop APlaceToReturn current
login
tick 1000
tick 1000
tick 1000
walk 0,3,50                             # trigger area 1, Status 0: 10048
finish                                  # Status 1
trigger Pherimociel                     # Status 1: 28
finish-if-event
trigger Auchefort                       # Status 1: 10055
finish-if-event
trigger Adolie
finish-if-event
trigger Chapi_Galepilai
finish-if-event
trigger Colti
finish-if-event
trigger Neraf-Najiruf                   # once per zone
finish-if-event
trigger Neraf-Najiruf                   # the second time
finish-if-event
warp 260,7.3,-436 MisareauxCoast
trigger _0p0                            # Option 0, none spawned: the Wardens pop
tick 2000
trigger _0p0                            # spawned: message 7375
finish-if-event
kill PM6_2_MOB_OFFSET                   # Option bit 0
kill PM6_2_MOB_OFFSET+1                  # bit 1
trigger _0p0                            # Option 3: the Wardens still stand: message 7375
finish-if-event
kill PM6_2_MOB_OFFSET+2                      # bit 2
trigger _0p0                            # Option 7: 10
finish                                  # the mission completes
